Description: Initialize pw in drop_privileges
 The numeric-UID path in drop_privileges() never assigned 'pw', and
 the initgroups resolver added in 94_security_privdrop_numeric_user
 reads it - an uninitialized pointer. Initialize it to NULL so the
 getpwuid() fallback is used as intended.
Origin: vendor
Forwarded: not-needed
---
--- a/src/nrpe.c	2026-10-03 01:37:49.016835367 +0200
+++ b/src/nrpe.c	2026-10-03 01:37:41.971942459 +0200
@@ -2435,7 +2464,7 @@
 	uid_t     uid = (uid_t)-1;
 	gid_t     gid = (gid_t)-1;
 	struct group *grp;
-	struct passwd *pw;
+	struct passwd *pw = NULL;
 
 	if (use_inetd == TRUE)
 		return OK;
